pp** — Peter Steinberger says the app now beats CLI for him because of speed, which means fewer windows. OpenAI’s Alexander Embiricos separately called the parallelism work a big unlock [6, 7].--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nHaonan Li\nUpdated March 8, 2026\nEducation\nUC River (https://haonan.me/about/resume.pdf)\nciteturn32164search15 [wordlim: 200] Published: 5 months ago; a domain-speciﬁc language for GPU programming, enables developers ... learning training processes by developing and implementing optimiza-tion techniques in collaboration with engineering teams. ... Research Assistant ... curity and assist in undergraduate/graduate students scientiﬁc research\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nC:\\Users\\hp\\Desktop\\February 17 (https://ipr.sikkim.gov.in/documents/english/74e04b38-d898-4dd6-9076-5d0003a7225a_February%2019.pdf)\nciteturn32164search16 [wordlim: 200] Published: 7 months ago; The training focused on Operational Guidelines: detailed instructions on digital data collection, verification protocols and public outreach strategies. ... Gangtok, February 16: Representatives from NGOs, ‘Serenity Home, Help Another’ and ‘Kudum’, called on Mr Ashit Rai Chairperson of Information and Public Relations Department at Gangtok and extended an invitation for the 5th edition of Tsomgo Ultra 5.0 scheduled to be held on March 8, 2026. ... He outlined key achievements since the GPU’s adoption under SAGY in 2016, including the completion of school infrastructure in Nampatam and Malling wards, establishment of a milk collection centre at Malling, a resource recovery centre and a plastic management unit. ... She observed that research has revealed deeply distressing circumstances behind many cases of school dropouts.\n"
